  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:0",
      "text": "Let's do the outage follow-up. Felix, what's the final count?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:1",
      "text": "Two hundred and twelve workspaces had sync paused for more than an hour over the weekend. Root cause was the queue migration. The rollback finished at 3:40."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:2",
      "text": "Support got about ninety tickets. Most were closed with the status page link, but around fifteen are still open and a couple are angry."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:3",
      "text": "Are those fifteen inside the two hundred and twelve?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:4",
      "text": "I think so. I haven't cross-checked."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:5",
      "text": "I can export the affected workspace list with the owner emails."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:6",
      "text": "Good. We agreed in the incident review that anyone down over an hour gets a credit. Is the credit applied automatically?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:7",
      "text": "Not yet. Billing needs a CSV. I'll have the credits applied by Thursday."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:8",
      "text": "OK. And the affected customers need to hear from us directly, not just through the status page."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:9",
      "text": "Agreed. The ones with open tickets keep asking whether it'll happen again."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:10",
      "text": "The postmortem draft answers that. We added a canary for the queue and a migration lock."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:11",
      "text": "Right. So we'll handle the customer emails by tomorrow. Plain language, the credit, and what we changed."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:12",
      "text": "Sounds good."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:13",
      "text": "Yep, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:14",
      "text": "Imani, can you also close out the open tickets once the email is out, pointing to it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:15",
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that with a macro."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:16",
      "text": "I'll publish the postmortem on the blog after legal reads it."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:17",
      "text": "Great. Anything else on the outage?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:18",
      "text": "Just that the status page went up twenty minutes late. We should look at that."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:19",
      "text": "That one's on the on-call checklist. I'll add a step for it."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-ownership-outage-email:seg:20",
      "text": "Thanks, both."
    }
  ],
